{
  "title": "Q046 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 046</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>46 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"46번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:43%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q046\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q045/\">이전 문제 <b>Q045</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">다음 문제 <b>Q047</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
